cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "SSAH SST Optical Data Processing Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A Python pipeline for optical space surveillance and tracking (SST):
  calibration, dual-track quality control, star-referenced astrometry
  against Gaia DR3, photometry, kinematic tracklet linking, SGP4/TLE
  correlation and CCSDS TDM / ADES output.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Iqbal
    given-names: Javed
    affiliation: "Sharjah Astronomical Observatory (SSAH)"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-03"
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/YOUR-GITHUB-USER/ssah-sst-pipeline"
keywords:
  - space surveillance and tracking
  - astrometry
  - photometry
  - satellite tracking
  - SGP4
  - FITS
